cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, please cite the associated manuscript.
title: >-
  Analysis code for "Migration by flight but not flight ability or loss accelerates molecular evolution in birds"
abstract: >-
  Sister-pair comparative analysis of 42 avian sister pairs across 84 taxa and
  roughly 14,800 protein-coding genes, testing whether gains of migration, losses
  of flight and a continuous wing-loading index are associated with shifts in
  molecular evolutionary rates, genome architecture, amino acid preferences, and
  selection on pathways within individual transitions.
authors:
